msgid "Your account can post new items from feeds by itself (your YouTube channel, your blog, your podcast), while you keep using it exactly as before: your own posts, comments, votes, chats and guilds are unchanged. Set it up in **Settings > Bots** under **Post automatically from your own account**: say what it posts and give up to %(num)s feeds. An admin approves it first, and every feed you add later."
msgid_plural "Your account can post new items from feeds by itself (your YouTube channel, your blog, your podcast), while you keep using it exactly as before: your own posts, comments, votes, chats and guilds are unchanged. Set it up in **Settings > Bots** under **Post automatically from your own account**: say what it posts and give up to %(num)s feeds. An admin approves it first, and every feed you add later."
msgstr[0] "El vostre compte pot publicar nous elements de fonts per si mateix (el vostre YouTube canal, el vostre bloc, el podcast), mentre continueu utilitzant- lo exactament com abans: els vostres propis articles, comentaris, vots, xats i gremis no són canviats. Establiu-lo a **Settings > Bots***s sota **Post automàticament des del vostre compte!: digueu quines publicacions hi ha i doneu-les a %(num)s fonts. Un administrador ho aprova primer, i totes les fonts que afegiu més tard."
msgstr[1] "El vostre compte pot publicar nous elements de fonts per si mateix (el vostre YouTube canal, el vostre bloc, el podcast), mentre continueu utilitzant- lo exactament com abans: els vostres propis articles, comentaris, vots, xats i gremis no són canviats. Establiu-lo a ** Settings > Bots***s sota **Post automàticament des del vostre compte!: digueu quines publicacions hi ha i doneu a %(num)s fonts. Un administrador ho aprova primer, i totes les fonts que afegiu més tard."

